{"unit_id":"ttmouse__dsh-taskboard#card-zh","repo":"ttmouse/dsh-taskboard","commit":"162a0c0342a607d77aa9a181dbbb172b764a5398","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-taskboard 是面向 DSH Web 的本地优先项目任务看板，在侧栏提供任务看板和自动化入口，并把任务列表嵌入会话右栏。它通过宿主内 SQLite 服务提供看板、列表、甘特图、工作流和仪表盘视图，支持任务详情、附件、标签、筛选及任务级 AI 对话。插件可将 DSH 工作区同步成项目，并按项目自动挑选待办任务、派发到 DSH 会话，执行进度通过评论回写。适合希望在 DSH 中管理项目任务并让 agent 按任务执行工作的用户。默认在本机保存数据并使用回环服务，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/src/client/index.tsx:1-20","plugin/lib/index.mjs:1093-1153"]}
{"unit_id":"ttmouse__dsh-taskboard#card-en","repo":"ttmouse/dsh-taskboard","commit":"162a0c0342a607d77aa9a181dbbb172b764a5398","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-taskboard adds a local task board to DSH Web with kanban, list, Gantt, workflow, and dashboard views. It syncs workspaces into projects and can dispatch eligible tasks to DSH sessions, recording progress as comments. Data stays on the machine; its internal service uses loopback.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/src/client/index.tsx:1-20","plugin/lib/index.mjs:1093-1153"]}
